        <!-- ===== BAGIAN C: PENUTUP ===== -->

        <Step id="c1" diagram="/diagrams/05/rekap.webp">
            <SectionDivider label="Penutup" />
            <StepHeader title="Recap" tone="primary" />
            <p class="text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed">
                User register, password di-hash, lalu login. Server membuat token JWT berisi identitas
                dan role. Token dikirim client di header{' '}
                <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;</code>{' '}
                setiap kali mengakses endpoint terlindungi.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border">
                <table class="w-full border-collapse text-left text-sm md:text-base">
                    <thead>
                        <tr class="bg-muted text-foreground">
                            <th class="px-3 py-2 font-semibold">Lapisan</th>
                            <th class="px-3 py-2 font-semibold">Tugas</th>
                            <th class="px-3 py-2 font-semibold">Gagal berarti</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="text-foreground-secondary">
                        <tr class="border-t border-border align-top">
                            <td class="px-3 py-2 font-semibold text-foreground">auth middleware</td>
                            <td class="px-3 py-2">Membuktikan identitas dari token</td>
                            <td class="px-3 py-2"><code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">401</code></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="border-t border-border align-top">
                            <td class="px-3 py-2 font-semibold text-foreground">role middleware</td>
                            <td class="px-3 py-2">Memeriksa role dari <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">req.user</code></td>
                            <td class="px-3 py-2"><code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">403</code></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="border-t border-border align-top">
                            <td class="px-3 py-2 font-semibold text-foreground">service</td>
                            <td class="px-3 py-2">Memeriksa kepemilikan objek</td>
                            <td class="px-3 py-2"><code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">403</code></td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr class="border-t border-border align-top">
                            <td class="px-3 py-2 font-semibold text-foreground">controller</td>
                            <td class="px-3 py-2">Menjalankan logika bisnis</td>
                            <td class="px-3 py-2"><code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">400</code> / <code class="font-mono text-[0.9em] bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">404</code></td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed">
                Lapisan-lapisan ini disambung dengan <strong>Dependency Injection</strong>: setiap
                komponen menerima kebutuhannya dari luar, sehingga mudah diuji dan diganti.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-foreground-secondary leading-relaxed">
                Intinya: <strong>autentikasi mengenal siapa kamu, otorisasi menentukan boleh apa,
                middleware yang menjaga pintunya.</strong>
            </p>
        </Step>

